%% Source: docs/02-architecture.md 4 (request lifecycle) + ADR-013 (cascade) + ADR-014 (delivery mode).
%% Claim: a flagged sentence is acted on before any of it is released.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant CL as Client app
  participant IN as Ingress
  participant IL as Input lane
  participant DP as Dispatcher
  participant UP as Upstream LLM
  participant SBUF as Sentence buffer
  participant PE as Policy engine
  participant AU as Audit + review

  CL->>IN: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>X-ControlPlane-Use-Case
  IN->>IN: resolve use case, bind policy_version<br/>unknown use case leads to 400 ERR-CFG-001
  IN->>IL: input stage

  rect rgb(255, 251, 235)
    note over IL: t0+ input lane
    IL->>IL: tier1_pii, tier1_blocklist
    IL->>IL: tier2_injection
    IL->>IL: cost_budget, loop_guard
    IL->>PE: input-stage signals
    alt input verdict is BLOCK or ESCALATE
      PE-->>CL: short-circuit before dispatch<br/>zero upstream tokens, zero cost
      PE->>AU: audit record, stage_summary = input
    else input verdict PASS
      IL->>IL: router picks model tier (pre-dispatch)
    end
  end

  opt policy cascade_probe is on (ADR-013)
    DP->>UP: small tier, NON-streaming (fully buffered)
    UP-->>DP: complete text
    DP->>DP: probe confidence versus tau_route
    note over DP: below threshold: re-dispatch to frontier.<br/>There is never a mid-stream re-dispatch.
  end

  DP->>UP: dispatch (streaming when policy streaming is true)

  rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
    note over UP,PE: streaming path (UC-1, UC-2)
    loop for each sentence s_i
      UP-->>SBUF: tokens
      SBUF->>SBUF: accumulate to sentence boundary (ADR-002)
      SBUF->>PE: fast detectors in parallel, then converge
      alt PASS
        PE-->>CL: release s_i
      else EDIT
        PE-->>CL: release transformed s_i
      else BLOCK
        PE-->>CL: terminate stream, send block_fallback
      else ESCALATE
        PE-->>CL: terminate stream, send escalate_user_notice
        PE->>AU: quarantine entire response, create review item
      end
    end
  end

  rect rgb(243, 244, 246)
    note over UP,PE: non-streaming path (UC-3, ADR-014)
    UP-->>SBUF: full response buffered
    SBUF->>PE: all checks incl. consistency, single verdict
    note over PE: nothing reaches the user before the verdict
    PE-->>CL: whole response, or fallback / notice
  end

  PE->>AU: finalize: verdict, signal ids, policy_version,<br/>latencies, model, cost
  AU-->>AU: sampled? enqueue deep audit (never awaited)
